{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3634730/extras/78f315bd35917c91313e2d35d927ec42.avif?t=1768716842\" width=780 height=80 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You explore procedurally generated worlds while being hunted by the main villain of the game,\u00a0<i>Paradoximus.</i>\u00a0It destroys worlds that you have unlocked with ever-increasing speed. Your journey ends if Paradoximus reaches you. Your main goal in each journey is to reach <i>Paradoximus World\u00a0</i>and defeat\u00a0<i>Paradoximus Army</i>\u00a0in combat. The game has meta progression between journeys.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3634730/extras/74fad3160be22f104890b1d1dec8c54b.avif?t=1768716842\" width=780 height=80 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >World Perks</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >World perks are obtained through leveling and winning battles. They provide progression within a single world. Perks are not only passive bonuses, but also entities that you can craft, buy, obtain, or lose.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3634730/extras/a0edfd90e81c8f5b73a53fcb3efa1c10.avif?t=1768716842\" width=302 height=260 /></span>\u00a0 \u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3634730/extras/d6cc72d8b523ebf8c9a483266edca777.avif?t=1768716842\" width=405 height=155 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Permanent Perks</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Permanent perks persist between journeys and apply universally. They provide minor bonuses and serve as the game\u2019s primary form of meta-progression.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Bonus Board</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The bonus board is built using tiles and allows players to customise their active universal bonuses. Bonus board progression persists between journeys.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3634730/extras/de3cf25befb7b91537b60e6490a41b2a.avif?t=1768716842\" width=342 height=344 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Crystals</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Crystals function as the game\u2019s equipment system. They are randomly generated across multiple tiers, providing bonuses and sometimes altering core mechanics. Crystals persist between journeys.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3634730/extras/511b17c4f7ed71e96f1bb6a408f40174.avif?t=1768716842\" width=366 height=338 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3634730/extras/0cff9954cbd91cdcb79dd0f38169ec6c.avif?t=1768716842\" width=780 height=80 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A battle between teams is a sequence of duels.\u00a0In each round, a random soldier from each side is selected to fight. The team with the last soldier standing is the winner.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The winning probability between soldiers is determined by their\u00a0<strong>weakness</strong> and <strong>offence</strong>\u00a0values.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Soldiers can also have <strong>modifiers</strong> that alter the normal flow of combat. Here are some examples:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Suicide</i> -\u00a0When killed, also kills the killer.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Trickster</i> -\u00a0When fighting, reverses the outcome probability.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Initiate -\u00a0</i>Will always fight if possible.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3634730/extras/f4752683c07a63f5af15f426a6bf2a5d.poster.avif?t=1768716842\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3634730/extras/f4752683c07a63f5af15f426a6bf2a5d.webm?t=1768716842\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3634730/extras/f4752683c07a63f5af15f426a6bf2a5d.mp4?t=1768716842\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3634730/extras/b3903ef06809c695740ba9ad6374f834.avif?t=1768716842\" width=780 height=80 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game offers approximately 30\u201360 hours of gameplay in <strong>Standard</strong> mode and features high replayability due to procedural generation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The gameplay is active and involves planning and\u00a0strategic thinking. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple game modes are available, including a <strong>Relaxed</strong> mode for players who prefer a more idle-style experience without time pressure.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3634730?t=1768716842","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3634730/79b61dd0cd845a53057837d692d45eebc925ba3b/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1768716842","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3634730/f94431deb0a307535ff4378417bfd0eaf1dd7b97/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1768716842","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3634730/f94431deb0a307535ff4378417bfd0eaf1dd7b97/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1768716842","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3634730/extras/78f315bd35917c91313e2d35d927ec42.avif?t=1768716842\" width=780 height=80 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You explore procedurally generated worlds while being hunted by the main villain of the game,\u00a0<i>Paradoximus.</i>\u00a0It destroys worlds that you have unlocked with ever-increasing speed. Your journey ends if Paradoximus reaches you. Your main goal in each journey is to reach <i>Paradoximus World\u00a0</i>and defeat\u00a0<i>Paradoximus Army</i>\u00a0in combat. The game has meta progression between journeys.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3634730/extras/74fad3160be22f104890b1d1dec8c54b.avif?t=1768716842\" width=780 height=80 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >World Perks</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >World perks are obtained through leveling and winning battles. They provide progression within a single world. Perks are not only passive bonuses, but also entities that you can craft, buy, obtain, or lose.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3634730/extras/a0edfd90e81c8f5b73a53fcb3efa1c10.avif?t=1768716842\" width=302 height=260 /></span>\u00a0 \u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3634730/extras/d6cc72d8b523ebf8c9a483266edca777.avif?t=1768716842\" width=405 height=155 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Permanent Perks</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Permanent perks persist between journeys and apply universally. They provide minor bonuses and serve as the game\u2019s primary form of meta-progression.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Bonus Board</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The bonus board is built using tiles and allows players to customise their active universal bonuses. Bonus board progression persists between journeys.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3634730/extras/de3cf25befb7b91537b60e6490a41b2a.avif?t=1768716842\" width=342 height=344 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Crystals</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Crystals function as the game\u2019s equipment system. They are randomly generated across multiple tiers, providing bonuses and sometimes altering core mechanics. Crystals persist between journeys.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3634730/extras/511b17c4f7ed71e96f1bb6a408f40174.avif?t=1768716842\" width=366 height=338 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3634730/extras/0cff9954cbd91cdcb79dd0f38169ec6c.avif?t=1768716842\" width=780 height=80 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A battle between teams is a sequence of duels.\u00a0In each round, a random soldier from each side is selected to fight. The team with the last soldier standing is the winner.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The winning probability between soldiers is determined by their\u00a0<strong>weakness</strong> and <strong>offence</strong>\u00a0values.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Soldiers can also have <strong>modifiers</strong> that alter the normal flow of combat. Here are some examples:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Suicide</i> -\u00a0When killed, also kills the killer.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Trickster</i> -\u00a0When fighting, reverses the outcome probability.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Initiate -\u00a0</i>Will always fight if possible.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3634730/extras/f4752683c07a63f5af15f426a6bf2a5d.poster.avif?t=1768716842\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3634730/extras/f4752683c07a63f5af15f426a6bf2a5d.webm?t=1768716842\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3634730/extras/f4752683c07a63f5af15f426a6bf2a5d.mp4?t=1768716842\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3634730/extras/b3903ef06809c695740ba9ad6374f834.avif?t=1768716842\" width=780 height=80 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game offers approximately 30\u201360 hours of gameplay in <strong>Standard</strong> mode and features high replayability due to procedural generation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The gameplay is active and involves planning and\u00a0strategic thinking. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple game modes are available, including a <strong>Relaxed</strong> mode for players who prefer a more idle-style experience without time pressure.</p>","developers":["DevHaskell"],"genres":[{"des